  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2wMZKZ7B6E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/735938861636780042?style=flat-square&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcozary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Ko--fi-F16061?style=flat-square&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> • <a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Colored-Water/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Cozary/Colored-Water?style=flat-square&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;color=364763\" alt=\"Issues\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fcolored-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/colored-water/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p><h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hEzgIwf.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">正在尋找一個簡單的裝飾模組？本模組加入了彩色水，讓你能隨心所欲地裝飾你的世界。同時也加入了濃縮彩色水。這兩者還有它們的發光變體！還有鍋釜！！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>與Optifine不相容，但可與Rubidium一起運作！（老實說，我到現在還不確定，有些版本似乎可以，有些則不行。）</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6IzYmBQ.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mrVcZRn.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>現在你可以將彩色水倒入鍋釜中了！</em></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3PAo8LX.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>合成方式：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">合成直觀又簡單。你只需要收集一桶水和一種染料。濃縮水則需要額外的染料，發光變體則需要螢光石粉！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K6HY17M.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
